    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "a29bb641-1de2-4a75-b03b-4eab9acd4083",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESpecialist battlefield guide throughout\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* hotel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E2 dinners included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EReturn Channel ferry crossings\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach throughout\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "f05a9263-8fc6-464e-924e-781658f95325",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EThree nights at the 4* Best Western Plus Alize Hotel in Mouscron. Facilities at the hotel include a bar, gymnasium and sauna. All rooms are en suite. Dinner is included in our hotel on Days 1 and 3 and the remaining night is on bed and breakfast basis.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "694d24bb-e6de-41fb-9ff8-21bfa8b5904b",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETalbot House in Poperinge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPloegsteert Memorial to the Missing\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESite of the Christmas Truce of 1914\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMessines Ridge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGerman trenches at Croonaert Wood\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHooge Crater Museum\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWorcestershire Regiment Memorial\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe Passchendaele Museum\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETyne Cot British \u0026amp; Commonwealth Cemetery\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u2018Last Post\u2019 Ceremony under the Menin Gate\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMuseum of the Great War at Peronne\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMine Crater at La Boiselle\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESouth African Memorial at Delville Wood\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMametz Wood Welsh Memorial\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDevonshire Trench British Cemetery\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThiepval Memorial\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETrenches at Newfoundland Park\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe Sunken Road at Beaumont Hamel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESheffield Park\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYpres\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "d2902d3e-f496-4d5e-9ad3-b04de140d6d2",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECarriere Wellington \u2013 a vast subterranean city of underground tunnels constructed by New Zealand miners during 1917 where at one stage over 20,000 men\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EArras Memorial to the Missing \u2013 bearing the names of almost 35,000 British soldiers lost on the battlefields of Arras\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBruges \u2013 the \u2018Venice of the North\u2019 and a UNESCO World Heritage Site, Bruges is famous for lace making, chocolate and its picturesque network of canals\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "be83263b-0f40-4014-ad7b-5e1cfe2d8711",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Talbot House\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoard our private executive coach at your designated pick up points \u2013 take the cross Channel ferry from your preferred port \u2013 after meeting our professional battlefield guide we visit Talbot House in Poperinge established by Tubby Clayton and Neville Talbot in 1915 and the birthplace of the Toc H movement \u2013 continue to the 4* Best Western Plus Alize Hotel in Mouscron \u2013 dinner in our hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Ypres Salient \u0026amp; \u2018Last Post\u2019 Ceremony\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOur battlefield guide takes us to see the sights and monuments of the infamous Ypres Salient in Belgium including the Ploegsteert Memorial to the Missing and the site of the Christmas Truce of 1914 \u2013 along the Messines Ridge, the area of the largest mining operation of the War, and then to the crypt of Messines church which was used as a dressing station during the War \u2013 the reconstructed German trenches at Croonaert Wood \u2013 time for lunch at the famous Hooge Crater Museum which houses a collection of arms and equipment from the War \u2013 the Worcestershire Regiment Memorial and the Passchendaele Museum keeps the memory alive of the 500,000 causalities of Passchendaele through images and films \u2013 Tyne Cot British and Commonwealth Cemetery and Memorial is the largest of its type in the world \u2013 this evening we attend the deeply moving \u2018Last Post\u2019 Ceremony under the Menin Gate which bears the names of almost 55,000 men whose bodies were never found.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 The Somme\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Museum of the Great War at Peronne contemplates the War on the front line and the effect it had on civilians behind the lines \u2013 after seeing the largest British Mine Crater at La Boiselle, we spend time at the South African Memorial at Delville Wood, Mametz Wood Welsh Memorial and Devonshire Trench British Cemetery \u2013 the largest British memorial in the world is at Thiepval \u2013 continue to the preserved trenches at Newfoundland Park and the Sunken Road at Beaumont Hamel \u2013 finish our time on the Somme at Sheffield Park, a memorial to the men of the many \u2018pals\u2019 battalions who fought in the area of Serre \u2013 dinner in our hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Ypres\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFree time in Ypres and a chance to visit the Flanders Fields Museum in the centre of the town \u2013 continue for our Channel crossing back to the UK and then return to our original departure points with comfort stops en route.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
